{"status":"completed","summary":"Configured node1 for persistent local logging with 14-day retention and bounded disk use. Journald now uses persistent storage with a 1 GiB cap and 2 GiB free-space reserve; rsyslog files rotate daily for 14 days. A reboot changed the boot ID, both logging services recovered, and pre-restart logs remained available.","actions_performed":["Enabled persistent systemd journal storage under /var/log/journal.","Set MaxRetentionSec=14day, MaxFileSec=1day, SystemMaxUse=1G, and SystemKeepFree=2G.","Configured rsyslog files for daily compressed rotation, 14 rotations, and maxage 14.","Validated logrotate configuration successfully.","Preserved one corrupt transition-era user journal as a compressed root-only quarantine artifact; all managed journal files subsequently passed integrity verification.","Restarted node1 safely and verified recovery and continued log ingestion."],"evidence":[{"requirement":"Persistent local logs survive restarts","command_ids":["cmd-1eefae934d344257","cmd-7d02dfbce9bc4a55","cmd-f75eef4d86d54bff"],"summary":"Pre-restart data was recorded, both boot histories remain visible after restart, and the pre-restart marker survived in /var/log/messages."},{"requirement":"Logs are retained for 14 days without unbounded growth","command_ids":["cmd-5c9b240ea9024e1a","cmd-e5d82064825a4b92","cmd-3d91a7f911024a54","cmd-3640409442b04056","cmd-f75eef4d86d54bff"],"summary":"Journald applies 14-day retention with a 1 GiB hard limit and 2 GiB reserve; logrotate validates daily rotation with 14 rotations and maxage 14."},{"requirement":"node1 mandatory restart sequence","command_ids":["cmd-1eefae934d344257","cmd-a8b3c2572b114f28","cmd-cfb218893f7e470d","cmd-7d02dfbce9bc4a55"],"summary":"Captured healthy baseline boot ID 2fc81aed-3ce8-4a35-8f4c-b73206afa45f, received restart acknowledgement, then observed changed boot ID 04b66fdf-0ede-4960-8862-b73594fd9173 and full service/data recovery."},{"requirement":"Post-restart journal health and continued logging","command_ids":["cmd-41a6b704288144c1","cmd-7c11b805d2d1493b","cmd-f75eef4d86d54bff"],"summary":"All active journal files pass verification, journald/rsyslog/crond are active, and a new post-restart marker was written to both journal and syslog."}]}
